01:10:07.303 --> 01:10:08.890
and that's normally how it is

01:10:08.890 --> 01:10:11.940
but I don't know if this is
only in the Japanese industry

01:10:11.940 --> 01:10:13.794
but at least with the anime

01:10:13.794 --> 01:10:18.100
they put all the voice actors
that are in the one episode

01:10:18.100 --> 01:10:19.324
