booth or one voice actor.

01:10:31.451 --> 01:10:32.620
- It's one after the other.
- One after the other.

01:10:32.620 --> 01:10:35.390
- But in anime it's you,
they do it all in one go.

01:10:35.390 --> 01:10:37.920
So if there's a current
scene where there are

01:10:37.920 --> 01:10:40.550
four voice actors, then
all four voice actors

01:10:40.550 --> 01:10:43.340
