01:10:45.610 --> 01:10:47.550
to deliver their line and when
they're not doing their line,

01:10:47.550 --> 01:10:48.630
they pull away from the microphone.

01:10:48.630 --> 01:10:51.657
- I think all cartoons used
to be that way in the West

01:10:51.657 --> 01:10:53.883
